## Admin UI Integration

Each admin page passes the appropriate `folder` prop to `ImageUpload`:

| Page | Folder |
|------|--------|
| Products (main + gallery) | `products` |
| Categories (main) | `categories` |
| Categories (subcategories) | `subcategories` |
| Banners | `banners` |

